# Shared UI package

`@company-of-heroes/ui` is presentational. Hosts inject data, map images, i18n, and navigation via props.

- No `$lib`, `$core`, `$app`, `$features`, Tauri, or PocketBase client
- `cn` from `@company-of-heroes/ui/cn`
- New public file → add an `exports` entry in `packages/ui/package.json`
- Interactive primitives wrap **bits-ui**; English default labels, overridable props

```json
"./player": "./src/player/index.ts"
```

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import { cn } from '@company-of-heroes/ui/cn';
	let { resolveMapSrc, label = 'Map' }: Props = $props();
</script>
```

```typescript
// ❌ BAD — import { pocketbase } from '$core/pocketbase' inside packages/ui
// ✅ GOOD — accept player/map data as props; app/website fetch
```

App may re-export from `$lib/components/ui/*` for app-only wrappers (Avatar, Table). Do not duplicate a shared component in website or app when this package already exports it.
